cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "antenna-cad: a design compiler for antenna and phased-array PCBs"
abstract: >-
  A Python package that compiles antenna design requirements into
  manufacturable KiCad PCB layouts through a typed intermediate
  representation: analytic synthesis of microstrip patches and corporate
  feed networks, deterministic board emission with real design-rule
  checking, full-wave verification with openEMS FDTD, and a
  simulate-and-correct tuning loop. Includes an MCP server so software
  agents can drive the same deterministic pipeline.
type: software
authors:
